526
00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:39.670
Why don't we let Rainn Wilson tell us?

527
00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:41.310
Rainn, what you got to say?

528
00:22:42.030 --> 00:22:44.310
Yes, it was a real live blowtorch.

529
00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:45.730
It was not a CGI flame.

530
00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:48.270
