00:34:29.210 --> 00:34:34.030
Jeff Blitz fought really hard to have the moment where the cat goes up in the ceiling

764
00:34:34.030 --> 00:34:36.030
and then out a different part of the ceiling.

765
00:34:36.270 --> 00:34:36.650
Yes.

766
00:34:36.810 --> 00:34:38.110
That was the thing he fought for.

